      "name": "transfer.inspectPackage",
      "description": "Inspect an uploaded package; completed progress returns packageInspection. Package admission uses a conservative 2 GiB expanded bound, 8 MiB zstd window, 16 MiB media map and ZIP directory, and 64 KiB metadata; large sets of tiny compressed media may exceed the conservative bound.",
